  "tagline": {
    "en": "Old Dhaka kacchi, sealed in the handi and opened at your table.",
    "bn": "পুরান ঢাকার কাচ্চি, হান্ডিতে মুখবন্ধ রান্না, খোলা হয় আপনার টেবিলে।"
  },
  "story": {
    "en": "On Road 27 since 1998. The kacchi goes into dough-sealed handis at 6 every morning and cooks over coal for four hours. The family cabins upstairs seat six to ten.",
